{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "New Paths", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Returning Your Call", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking on the Phone", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To keep a conversation going in English, it's important to show that you are interested in talking to your friend. When you couldn't answer the phone you need to return your call as soon as possible this shows that you are interested in talking to someone.<br /><br /> For example:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">Hey Sally, I'm returning your call!</span> <br /><span class=\"italic\">Peter! How are you?</span><br /><br />On the other hand, you can also show interest by asking questions or by responding to or commenting on what the person you are talking to says.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Speaker\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Listener\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Waiting for a response from the PR firm is stressful.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Wow. You're always so easy-going and calm.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That's good for PR right?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yeah. I'll just have to wait.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going apartment hunting in Boston this weekend.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There's the old optimistic Peter!</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Future with Will,  Be Going To, and the Present Continuous", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Talking about the future can be very confusing ...", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when you decide to do something at the moment of speaking or when you are not sure about the future. You also use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to make promises, to offer or refuse, and to predict the future.<br> For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">Come on, I'll help you with those bags. <br> Maybe I'll go to Hawaii this year. <br> Ah! I see from your hand that you will live to be 100 years old!</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> to when you have decided to do something in a general way. You intend to do it, but you have not finalized your plans or booked anything yet.<br> For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to take some more courses next year. <br> We're going to go to Europe in the spring.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> to make a prediction when there is some evidence. <br> For example: <br><span class=\"italic\"> Look at those black clouds! It's going to rain soon. <br> It's already 6:00? I'm going to be late!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> to talk about future events and that are planned. Arrangements or appointments have been made.<br> For example: <br><span class=\"italic\"> I'm seeing the dentist tomorrow at 4:00 p.m. <br> We're having a party next Saturday and want you to come.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span> tense for the future with schedules and timetables. This is for things and not for people.<br> For example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">My plane leaves at 7:00 p.m. next Wednesday.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You're going to take an apartment without a job? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm going to be starting at the bottom. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You'll have an idea of what's available.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll just have to wait.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The fall semester starts in three weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I'm sending out a second set of resumes next week.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "stressful ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing worry and anxiety  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: His job is very stressful at times. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "easy-going ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relaxed; tolerant ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My boss is very easy-going. Nothing upsets him. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "practical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "choosing appropriate doable action  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They alway arrive at a practical solution to a problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "asset ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something useful or valuable ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is an asset to the firm. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "personable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pleasant; likable ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The secretary is extremely personable. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "talkative ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fond of talking; chatty ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He is talkative and puts customers at ease. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob05aud06  ", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Review the dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 7 words that describe personality and behavior that will help you get or move up in a job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use these words to write sentences saying how they make you an asset to your job. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give an example for each.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 7 words to describe personality and behavior.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I say how this type of personality and behavior makes me an asset to a job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img06.jpg", "time": "1", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey Sally. I'm returning your call! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter! How are you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm okay. I'm usually a very patient person, but waiting for a response from the PR firm is stressful.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Wow. You're always so easy-going and calm. This PR job must mean a lot to you. <br>"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "time": "20000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm going apartment hunting in Boston this weekend. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're going to take an apartment without a job? There's the old optimistic Peter!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll have a good look at places. I won't take a place until I'm hired.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'll have an idea of what's available. You're showing your practical side.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm sending out a second set of resumes next week. I'm going to be starting at the bottom. I'd be an asset in social media or public relations. <br>"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "50500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You'll find a place and do well. You're personable and talkative. That's good for PR right?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah. I'll just have to wait. I'm going to find a place to work. I just want it to be right for me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Something is coming for you. I feel it. Bye!<br>"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le01ob05re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about job and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about behavior and personality. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action, plans and intentions. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How do you usually feel when you're in a job interview?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Wha